::lines pbp.out.glove
Glove save, {goalie}!
{goalie} snags it.
{goalie} picks it out of the air.
Into the glove.
Flashes the leather, {goalie}.
{goalie} with the glove. Shows it to him.
::endlines

::lines pbp.out.pad
Pad save, {goalie}!
Kick save, {goalie}!
{goalie} kicks it out.
Off the pad.
{goalie} drops and stops it.
{goalie} gets a toe on it.
::endlines

::lines pbp.out.blocked
Blocked!
A defender eats it.
Blocked in front.
Off a shin pad. That'll bruise.
Somebody lay down in front of it.
Gets in the lane. Blocked.
