::lines pbp.rebound
Rebound!
Rebound loose!
Rebound, and it's cleared.
Juicy rebound. Nobody home.
Rebound to the corner.
Loose in front!
::endlines

# The call as it goes in. Write the hold the way a caller makes it: a held letter is a
# held sound ("SCOOOOORES" leans on the o for about a sixth of a second a letter), and
# "!!!" is a harder shout than "!". See docs/bsm-format.md.
::lines pbp.goal
He SCOOOOOOORES!!!
SCOOOOOORES!!!
Top shelf! He SCOOOOOORES!!!
{shooter} SCOOOOORES!!!
He SCOOOORES! It's IN!
Five-hole! It's IN THERE!
GOAL! {team}!
He buries it!
::endlines

::lines pbp.goal.celebrate
{shooter} wheels away.
{shooter} heads for the glass.
{shooter} peels off to the boards.
{shooter} goes down on one knee and fires the arrow.
{shooter} skates off with his arms up.
::endlines

