::lines pbp.death.still
Nobody is moving.
The building goes quiet.
He's not moving.
::endlines

::lines pbp.death.helmets
Helmets come off.
The players gather round.
Heads down along both benches.
::endlines

::lines pbp.scrum.whistle
Whistle.
The ref blows it dead.
Whistle. Pushing after it.
::endlines

::lines pbp.pull.extra
Extra attacker on for {team}.
Empty net. Six skaters for {team}.
{team} goes six on five.
