::lines pbp.goal.slump
{goalie} hangs his head.
{goalie} slumps.
{goalie} stares at the rafters.
{goalie} fishes it out.
::endlines

::lines pbp.faceoff.drop
Dropped.
Puck's down.
{winner} and {loser}. Dropped.
{loser} and {winner}, and it's down.
In it goes.
