::lines pbp.period.out
Teams are out.
Both benches are full.
The Zamboni's gone back through its gate.
::endlines

# Said once the first draw of a period has been won: the period is under way.
::lines pbp.period.go
And we're under way.
Under way.
Play's on.
::endlines

::lines pbp.after.glove
He holds it. Whistle.
Held. Whistle.
He's not giving that back.
::endlines

::lines pbp.after.pad
Kicked to the corner.
Steered wide.
Out to the side boards.
Kicked clear.
::endlines

::lines pbp.after.blocked
Loose in the slot.
It squirts out to the point.
Bounces away.
He limps after it.
