::lines pbp.after.wide
Rims around the back.
Behind the net and gone.
Round the boards.
::endlines

::lines pbp.after.post
Rattles out.
Away to the corner.
Still out.
Nobody can find it.
::endlines

::lines pbp.after.breakaway
{shooter} stumbles.
{shooter} loses his feet.
{shooter} is left looking at it.
