::lines pbp.hit.shatter
The glass explodes!
Pane's gone!
Glass everywhere!
Straight through the glass!
::endlines

::lines pbp.hit.helmet
Helmet's off.
Lid's gone.
Helmet bouncing away.
::endlines

::lines pbp.hit.stick
